WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:02,710
Almost forgot

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:04,540
Put this plate back and keep it

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,020
Let's see if we can drag out the monster later.

4
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:19,550
It's been two hours. Isn't it available?

5
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,920
Damn it, here it comes

6
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,040
Korean laws hurt people

7
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,740
Heaven after heaven

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,900
I smell the scent of rich people

9
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,300
That's a delicious thing that only nobles can use

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,580
Hello just in front

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:35,620
nice to meet you

12
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:40,670
Brother, don't go

13
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:41,910
I want to buy goods

14
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:44,140
I clearly feel it

15
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,020
Why does the call from a wealthy man come after that?

16
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,020
Indeed a provocateur

17
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:51,060
How could it be? Don’t worry, I’m super rich, except for the Boluwan that I have in my hat.

18
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,700
Will definitely buy me two more items

19
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:55,660
I will never let you lose money, dear poor poor
